---

<section id="checklist" class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-ink-700 bg-ink-850">
  <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border-b border-ink-700 px-5 py-4">
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-sand-100">GEO Readiness Checklist</h3>
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-sand-500">
        How likely are AI assistants to find, trust and quote this entity? Click any item for the fix.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="shrink-0 text-right">
      <span id="checklist-score" class="text-lg font-extrabold text-mint-400">–/–</span>
      <div class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-20 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-ink-700">
        <div id="checklist-bar" class="h-full rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-mint-500 to-cyan-400 transition-all duration-300" style="width: 0%"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <ul id="checklist-list" class="divide-y divide-ink-700/70"></ul>

  <p class="px-5 py-3 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-sand-500">
    Based on entity signals that matter to generative engines: <code class="text-sand-400">sameAs</code>,
    <code class="text-sand-400">citation</code> and <code class="text-sand-400">publisher/author</code> connections.
  </p>
</section>
